Change-Id: rvsxmkkrwyrsouzoltkozuqwvptxpktr

The process-email loop only reindexed the list between passes. Each
model pass fetched and rebased by following prose in the skill, so
whether a pass started from the current trunk and list depended on
the model carrying out those steps faithfully.

Fetching and rebasing need no judgement. A script does them the same
way every time, and the loop now runs it before each lookup, so the
next message is picked from the current list. The model is left only
what does take judgement: conflicts the rebase left behind and
patches applied upstream with edits. Running the script again is
harmless, so a pass can call the same recipe itself.
